      "body": "# Introduce\n主页：https://app.whyengineer.com/\n仓库：https://github.com/ecubus/EcuBus-Pro\n\n这个是一个比较小众专业的工具，对应的是汽车软件工程师\n这个领域的软件硬件的收费通常都很贵\n\n这是一个完全开源的项目，面向global 全球汽车软件工程师\n\n# Tech Arch\n基于Electron，用了大量nodejs addon 来封装 dll 库和c++ 优化。\n\n# Fectures\n🆓 Open-source and free to use\n🚀 Modern, intuitive user interface\n💻 Cross-platform support (Windows, Linux, MacOS) - [Install](https://github.com/ecubus/EcuBus-Pro/blob/master/docs/about/install.md)\n🔌 Multi-hardware support\nPEAK: CAN, CAN-FD, LIN\nKVASER: CAN, CAN-FD\nZLG: CAN, CAN-FD\nToomoss: CAN, CAN-FD, LIN\n🛠️ Comprehensive diagnostic capabilities\nDiagnostic Protocols: CAN/CAN-FD, DoIP, LIN\n📝 Scripting: Advanced TypeScript-based automation - [Details](https://github.com/ecubus/EcuBus-Pro/blob/master/docs/um/script.md)\n🧪 Test: HIL Test Framework - [Details](https://github.com/ecubus/EcuBus-Pro/blob/master/docs/um/test/test.md)\n📊 Database Support: LIN LDF (edit & export), CAN DBC (view) - [Details](https://github.com/ecubus/EcuBus-Pro/blob/master/docs/um/database.md)\n📈 Data Visualization: Real-time signal graphing and analysis - [Details](https://github.com/ecubus/EcuBus-Pro/blob/master/docs/um/graph/graph.md)\n⌨️ Command Line: Full-featured CLI for automation and integration - [Details](https://github.com/ecubus/EcuBus-Pro/blob/master/docs/um/cli.md)\n\n# Images\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e90d8cc-bdc1-4c7c-bb22-a01d7efb8d54)\n",
